# Prettier must not touch the docs (M14, learned the hard way).
#
# `bun run format` only targets code files, so this never bit anyone — until an
# agent ran `prettier --write` on a docs path directly. Prettier parses `.mdx`
# as JSX and reflows the markdown TABLES inside `<RollableTable>` into a single
# paragraph of pipes, destroying every rolled table on the page.
#
# The rulebook's markdown is content, not code. It is formatted by its authors
# and by `bun run content:gen`, and neither wants a JSX formatter's opinion.
docs/
